      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"rizen-features\">\n  <h2 class=\"rizen-features__title\">WHAT SETS RIZEN™ APART FROM GENERIC HAIR FIBER POWDERS:</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"rizen-features__grid\">\n\n    <!-- Left column -->\n    <div class=\"rizen-features__col\">\n      <div class=\"rizen-features__item\">\n        <span class=\"rizen-features__icon\">💧</span>\n        <h3>SWEAT & WATERPROOF</h3>\n        <p>No streaks, no smudging — lasts up to 48h even in the gym.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rizen-features__item\">\n        <span class=\"rizen-features__icon\">🕶️</span>\n        <h3>100% UNDETECTABLE</h3>\n        <p>Looks like real hair. No one will ever know.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Center image -->\n    <div class=\"rizen-features__center\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/2981/1738/files/07dcc0186d4545df8542924db385cb12-ezgif.com-optimize.webp?v=1774812263\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right column -->\n    <div class=\"rizen-features__col\">\n      <div class=\"rizen-features__item\">\n        <span class=\"rizen-features__icon\">🎯</span>\n        <h3>TARGETED PRECISION</h3>\n        <p>Cover bald spots exactly where you need it — instant full coverage.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rizen-features__item\">\n        <span class=\"rizen-features__icon\">⛅</span>\n        <h3>WEATHER-PROOF CONFIDENCE</h3>\n        <p>Rain, wind, heat — stays locked in all day, no excuses.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .rizen-features {\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 48px 24px;\n    width: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__title {\n    font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 26px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    margin: 0 0 48px 0;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 24px;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 48px;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__item {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__icon {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__item h3 {\n    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.4vw, 14px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #111;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__item p {\n    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.2vw, 13px);\n    color: #444;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__center {\n    width: clamp(180px, 30vw, 380px);\n  }\n\n  .rizen-features__center img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    object-fit: cover;\n  }\n\n  /* Mobile */\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .rizen-features__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .rizen-features__center {\n      width: 220px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      order: -1;\n    }\n\n    .rizen-features__col {\n      gap: 32px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
